; ZigZag_Settings_Matrix
; Bambu Lab P1S / 0.2 mm nozzle / PETG
; 21 pairs, printed sequentially left to right; 10 mm pair-center pitch
; Identical geometry from newest 2CustomZigZag plate file; 10 mm intro/outro each
; Nominal repeat 0.3 mm; width 0.15 mm; layer height 0.06 mm
; Six single-layer pairs (0.06 mm); fifteen four-layer pairs (0.24 mm)
; Total layer events: 66; maximum model Z: 0.24 mm
; Nozzle 245 C; bed 85 C; purge-line XY speed 20 mm/s
; All four-layer first layers: 1 mm/s, part fan off
; Part fan P1 explicitly controlled; auxiliary fan remains off
; See ZigZag_Settings_Matrix.svg and .csv for the left-to-right key
; Static validation only; not printer-tested
